🏠 首页



                  使用说明 



每次打开 Vault 先看这里：今天要干什么（今日待办）+ 正在推进什么（活跃项目）。



✅ 今日待办
一、今天到期与已逾期
TASK
FROM &quot;0-Inbox&quot; OR &quot;1-Projects&quot; OR &quot;2-Areas&quot; OR &quot;3-Resources&quot;
WHERE !completed AND due AND due &lt;= date(today)
SORT due ASC
二、全部未完成任务（按来源文件分组）
TASK
FROM &quot;0-Inbox&quot; OR &quot;1-Projects&quot; OR &quot;2-Areas&quot; OR &quot;3-Resources&quot;
WHERE !completed
GROUP BY link(file.path, choice(length(split(file.folder, &quot;/&quot;)) &gt; 1, split(file.folder, &quot;/&quot;)[1], file.folder) + choice(file.name = &quot;_index&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot; · &quot; + file.name))

🚀 活跃项目（近 3 天有改动）
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  link(file.path, choice(length(split(file.folder, &quot;/&quot;)) &gt; 1, split(file.folder, &quot;/&quot;)[1], file.folder)) AS &quot;项目&quot;,
  choice(file.name = &quot;_index&quot;, &quot;项目主页&quot;, file.name) AS &quot;文件&quot;,
  default(status, &quot;未标注&quot;) AS &quot;状态&quot;,
  file.mtime AS &quot;最后修改&quot;
FROM &quot;1-Projects&quot;
WHERE file.mtime &gt;= date(today) - dur(3 days)
SORT file.mtime DESC

📥 收件箱速览
LIST
FROM &quot;0-Inbox&quot;
WHERE file.name != this.file.name
SORT file.ctime DESC
LIMIT 10

📊 系统状态
const inbox = dv.pages(&#039;&quot;0-Inbox&quot;&#039;).length;
const proj  = dv.pages(&#039;&quot;1-Projects&quot;&#039;).length;
const areas = dv.pages(&#039;&quot;2-Areas&quot;&#039;).length;
const res   = dv.pages(&#039;&quot;3-Resources&quot;&#039;).length;

const tasks = dv.pages(&#039;&quot;0-Inbox&quot; OR &quot;1-Projects&quot; OR &quot;2-Areas&quot; OR &quot;3-Resources&quot;&#039;)
  .file.tasks.where(t =&gt; !t.completed).length;

dv.table(
  [&quot;指标&quot;, &quot;数值&quot;],
  [
    [&quot;未完成任务总数&quot;, tasks],
    [&quot;收件箱条目&quot;, inbox],
    [&quot;进行中项目&quot;, proj],
    [&quot;领域（Areas）&quot;, areas],
    [&quot;资源笔记&quot;, res],
  ]
);
